### Load-Use Hazard Detection

#### LD followed by dependent ALU detects hazard

- Verify: LD followed by dependent ALU detects hazard
   - Expected: hazard is true


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 7 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: LD followed by dependent ALU detects hazard")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
val hazard = detect_load_use_hazard(
    ex_is_load: true, ex_rd: 10,
    id_rs1: 10, id_rs2: 0
)
expect(hazard).to_equal(true)
```

